<section id="evaluation" class="brdr-bttm">
	<h2>Évaluation associé</h2>
	<p>Listes des évaluation associé par date de consultation lorsqu'ils ont été considérées de quelques façons formel ou informel à la rédaction de ce rapport de conformance.</p>
	<ul data-wb-json='{
			"url": "#[a11y]/acr:assessment",
			"mapping": [
				{ "selector": "[data-rel-json]", "value": "/@id", "attr": "data-rel-json" },
				{ "selector": "[lang]", "value": "/dct:language", "attr": "lang" },
				{ "selector": "a", "value": "/dct:title" },
				{ "selector": "a", "value": "/dct:references", "attr": "href" },
				{ "selector": "time", "value": "/dct:date" }
			]
		}'>
		<template>
			<li data-rel-json lang><time></time> - <a href></a></li>
		</template>
	</ul>
</section>

<section id="travaux" class="brdr-bttm">
	<h2>Travaux</h2>
	<p>Cette section est offert à titre d'information. La réalisation des travaux suivant peuvent ou pas être requis afin de satisfaire à la conformité de la normeé L'intention est créer des liens et d'identifier des travaux associé car ils pourraient être pertinent dans l'interprétation de ce rapport de conformance à l'accessibilité. L'état actuel des travaux n'est pas indiqué et ne sera pas suivi ici.</p>

	<dl data-wb-json='{
			"url": "#[a11y]/acr:workItem",
			"mapping": [
				{ "selector": "a[data-title]", "value": "/dct:title" },
				{ "selector": "a[data-title]", "value": "/dct:references", "attr": "href" },
				{ "selector": "[data-requirement]", "value": "/acr:requirement" },
				{ "selector": "[data-created]", "value": "/dct:created" },
				{ "selector": "[data-severity]", "value": "/acr:severity" },
				{ "selector": "[data-relevancy]", "value": "/acr:relevancy" },
				{ "selector": "[data-description]", "value": "/dct:description" }
			]
		}'>
		<template>
			<dt class="h3" lang="en"><a data-title href></a></dt>
			<dd>
				<p class="clearboth"><strong>Associé à l'exigence:</strong> <span data-requirement>Pas spéficié</span></p>
				<ul class="list-inline">
					<li><em>Date:</em> <span data-created></span></li>
					<li><em>Gravité:</em> <span data-severity>Pas spéficié</span></li>
					<li><em>Pertinence:</em> <span data-relevancy>Pas spéficié</span></li>
				</ul>
				<p data-description lang="en"></p>
			</dd>
		</template>
	</dl>
</section>

<section id="verifications" class="brdr-bttm">
	<h2>Vérifications d'évaluation</h2>
	<table class="table">
		<thead>
			<tr>
				<th>Date</th>
				<th>Exactitude</th>
				<th>Détails</th>
			</tr>
		</thead>
		<tbody data-wb-json='{
			"url": "#[a11y]/acr:audits",
			"tobeclone": "tr",
			"source": "#tmpl-audits",
			"mapping": [
				{ "selector": "[data-reviewon]", "value": "/dct:issued" },
				{ "selector": "[data-accuracy]", "value": "/acr:accuracy" },

				{ "selector": "[data-reviewer]", "value": "/earl:assertedBy/foaf:name" },
				{ "selector": "[data-reviewer]", "value": "/earl:assertedBy/foaf:homepage", "attr": "href" },

				{ "selector": "[data-assessment]", "value": "/acr:assessment/dct:language", "attr": "lang" },
				{ "selector": "a[data-assessment-ref]", "value": "/acr:assessment/dct:title" },
				{ "selector": "a[data-assessment-ref]", "value": "/acr:assessment/dct:references", "attr": "href" },
				{ "selector": "[data-assessment-date]", "value": "/acr:assessment/dct:date" },

				{ "selector": "[data-mode]", "value": "/earl:mode" },
				{ "selector": "[data-applicability]", "value": "/earl:subject/acr:applicability" },
				{ "selector": "[data-summary]", "value": "/dct:description" },
				{ "selector": "[data-audit-notes]", "value": "/acr:auditNotes",
					"mapping": [
						{ "selector": "[data-note-accuracy]", "value": "/acr:accuracy" },
						{ "selector": "[data-note-severity]", "value": "/acr:severity" },
						{ "selector": "[data-note-relevancy]", "value": "/acr:relevancy" },
						{ "selector": "[data-note-title]", "value": "/dct:title" },
						{ "selector": "[data-note-test]", "value": "/earl:test" },
						{ "selector": "[data-note-description]", "value": "/dct:description" }
					]
				}
			]
		}'>
		</tbody>
	</table>

	<template id="tmpl-audits">
		<table>
			<tr>
				<th data-reviewon></th>
				<td data-accuracy></td>
				<td>
					<dl class="dl-horizontal">
						<dt>Par:</dt>
						<dd><a data-reviewer href>Inconnu</a></dd>
						<dt>Vérification de l'évaluation:</dt>
						<dd data-assessment lang>
							<time data-assessment-date></time> - <a data-assessment-ref href></a>
						</dd>
						<dt>Mode de vérification:</dt>
						<dd><code data-mode></code></dd>
						<dt>Porté:</dt>
						<dd data-applicability lang="en"><span lang="fr">Non redéfinie</span></dd>
						<dt>Note:</dt>
						<dd>
							<p data-summary lang="en"></p>
							<div data-audit-notes>
								<template>
									<details>
										<summary><strong data-note-accuracy></strong> - <span data-note-title lang="en">Title</span></summary>
										<p>À propos du test: <span data-note-test></span></p>
										<p>Gravité: <span data-note-severity></span>; Pertinance <span data-note-relevancy></span></p>
										<p data-note-description lang="en"></p>
									</details>
								</template>
							</div>
						</dd>
					</dl>
				</td>
			</tr>
		</table>
	</template>

</section>

